+| nBTC - NEAR | <https://app.rhea.finance/sauce/5949> |
+| DOG - NBTC | <https://app.rhea.finance/pool/6424> |
+### How it works
 Lock xRHEA → Earn Weight → Get Boosted APYs on Farming
 The program operates in two sections:
-Weight Algorithm – Calculates your Weight based on the amount and duration of xRHEA locked.
-Farming Multiplier Algorithm – Converts your Weight into a reward boost factor.
-1. Weight Algorithm
+1. Weight Algorithm – Calculates your Weight based on the amount and duration of xRHEA locked.
+2. Farming Multiplier Algorithm – Converts your Weight into a reward boost factor.
